  "title": "Guy Approved Meatloaf",
  "description": "This smoky meatloaf made with ground beef, barbecue sauce, liquid smoke, potato chips, and bacon is so tasty... Everyone will want second helpings!",
  "authors": [
    "Angie Gorkoff"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-12-29T01:39:53-05:00",
